This package is an independent implementation. Its span format and timing rules
(inclusive and own time computed from the union of child intervals, wall time as
the union of root spans, per-span exclusive token counts, and the before and after
regression report idea) follow the "Agent Trace Debugger" project in:

  AI Engineering from Scratch
  https://github.com/rohitg00/ai-engineering-from-scratch
  Copyright (c) rohitg00, MIT License

No source code from that project is copied into this package.

